1
00:00:00,475 --> 00:00:04,775
(Leonard:)We could throw a dinner party too.
Maybe even ask everyone to get dressed up.

2
00:00:04,946 --> 00:00:08,246
Sure. Just, when you say "dressed up,"
you mean nice clothes, right?

3
00:00:08,417 --> 00:00:11,177
(Penny:)Not like capes and tights and crap.

4
00:00:13,355 --> 00:00:14,585
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

5
00:00:14,756 --> 00:00:16,486
(Leonard:)- Although...
- No.

6
00:00:23,432 --> 00:00:27,662
- Howie, you okay?
- Yeah, I just couldn't sleep.

7
00:00:27,836 --> 00:00:30,496
I told you you shouldn't
have espresso after dinner.

8
00:00:30,672 --> 00:00:34,332
(Bernadette:)I know the little cups make you
feel big, but it's not worth it.

9
00:00:36,945 --> 00:00:38,435
(Howard:)It's this stupid letter.

10
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:41,370
- Did you read it?
- No.

11
00:00:41,983 --> 00:00:44,613
- You must be curious.
- Of course I'm curious.

12
00:00:44,786 --> 00:00:49,386
(Howard:)I haven't seen the man
since I was a little kid.

13
00:00:49,591 --> 00:00:52,461
(Howard:)And a letter shows up
on my 18th birthday.

14
00:00:52,627 --> 00:00:53,717
(Howard:)What's that about?

15
00:00:54,129 --> 00:00:55,389
Then why don't you read it?

16
00:00:55,597 --> 00:00:58,467
(Bernadette:)Maybe he apologizes
or explains why he left.

